  "term": "attention disorder",
  "definition": "Attention disorder refers to difficulties with maintaining attention over time and across tasks. In the packet, it is described as ADHD, a neurodevelopmental disorder involving a lasting pattern of inattention, hyperactivity-impulsivity, or both that disrupts functioning or development.",
